      "writtenOn": "2023-07-26T16:20:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we also do a \n\n```\n#ifndef STREAM_RENDERER_LOGGING_LEVEL\n#define STREAM_RENDERER_LOGGING_LEVEL STREAM_RENDERER_LOGGING_LEVEL_ERROR\n#endif\n```\n\nhere? This helps document what needs to be set so readers don\u0027t have to look into the logging implementation to find out. Potentially, this let\u0027s you drop parts of aosp/2673897 and aosp/2675628.",
      "revId": "2fbef6c698485c3e7bcf49eddaf8abcfcb315cdd",
